Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope I'm not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please! Silica!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't send this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came as soon as we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen yourself lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You push yourself way too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We brought everyone with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can take it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:00:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those big stun ones are the bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vanguard, with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.26,0:01:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drive them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rearguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.70,0:01:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall back with the Underworld!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check your spells!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so we're clear, this\Nain't nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the same, you're gonna pay\Nfor what you did to our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, now that that's settled,\Nhere comes the pain, you bastards!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:23.81,0:01:28.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(960,220)\fnTriggering Fanfares\b0\fscx65\c&HEEF1F5&\blur0.85}"What is the color of your soul?"
