Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we work\Nso hard in SAO and ALO?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's this, to protect the people\Nwe love whenever and wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the Underworld's\Non a closed network.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who told you how to log on to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you'd ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told us everything that was going\Non with the Underworld and its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've never seen her\Nget so emotional before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for looking out for us, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Lady Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are these new people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they knights or mercenaries?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're my best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They came from the real world to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought everyone from your\Nworld, aside from Lady Asuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of course, were brutes\Nlike those soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course we're not all like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Lisbeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put her there, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Renly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pleasure to meet you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many people converted in with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a little over 2,000 came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to get more, but even after\Nspilling my guts to the council,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's all I could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if reconverting is an\Noption for real worlders,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this could turn into a war of attrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should focus on healing and\Nkeep the front line from spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a support unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz, Silica, could you fall\Nback with 200 and form one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get right on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how skilled you are in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you're okay with it,\NI need you to teach healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My world doesn't have sacred art.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I thought if you and your\Npriests taught our warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might give us the edge we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to the front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that everyone's here, we won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can beat them, I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, we will win!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.33,0:06:44.30,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HEEEAEA&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(1399.513,830.533)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(18,138,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(36,156,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(55,175,\alpha&H00&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(73,193,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(91,211,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(110,230,\alpha&H00&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(128,248,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(146,266,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(165,285,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(183,303,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(201,321,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(220,340,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(238,358,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(256,376,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(275,395,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(293,413,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(311,431,\alpha&H00&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(330,450,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(348,468,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(366,486,\alpha&H00&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(385,505,\alpha&H00&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(403,523,\alpha&H00&)}8 {\alpha&HFF&\t(421,541,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(440,560,\alpha&H00&)}M {\alpha&HFF&\t(458,578,\alpha&H00&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(476,596,\alpha&H00&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(494,614,\alpha&H00&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(513,633,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(531,651,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(550,670,\alpha&H00&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(568,688,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(586,706,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(605,725,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(623,743,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(641,761,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(660,780,\alpha&H00&)}e
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I hope I logged them all in, in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have anticipated\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When those girls told us the hijackers\Nlogged American players into the underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just went numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, for some AI in\NAsuna's phone to be the one that spots it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should turn in my keyboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it happened the way it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that all these\Ncivilians are logged in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Project Alicization\Nisn't a secret anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's out in the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a huge problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But compared to the\Nenemy getting their hands
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on Alice and using her\Nto pilot war drones?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I prefer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not an AI anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:08:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice is a new type of humanity, born\Nand raised in an alternate world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you knew that way before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Harenko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his Fluctlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the activity log!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What caused those spikes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever they were, they triggered\Nhis consciousness at those two points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the log says he's still out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something made an impression though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The timestamps check them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you anything those are\Nwhen the girls in the STLs dove in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that all it took to make\Nhim react were friends of his? Showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind of damage\NKirito's got can't be fixed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by some kind of poetic\Nexplanation like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a more logical reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The self.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The image he has of\Nhimself that defines him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could there be a backup\Nof that quantum pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never made a copy\Nof Kirito's Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if there was a copy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'd be impossible to extract his\Nself-image and transfer it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, wait a sec. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there Was an active quantum pattern\Nthat could Connect to his Fluctlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but where would we find that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The subject observes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The object is observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't separate them\Nthat clearly and easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:09:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Subjective and objective\Nare just philosophical
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,concepts that explain the\Nrelationship of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since humans are social\Ncreatures, not isolated individuals,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have an image of others in your\Nmind, and they have one of you in theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like we're all connected, up to a\Npoint, in a kind of network, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The image of me in others?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's like a backup of the self-image
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it we got it we can restore
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his subjective self-image we have the\Ndata it's in the floodlights of the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people he's closest to all right we\Nwant to extract that data we need an STL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and reproducing it'll take more than\None person we're gonna need two no three
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Keeks, the girls diving from\NRoppongi, how tight are they with Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they close?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard about the Death\NGun case six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon helped Kirito crack that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Leafa is Kirito's little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got what we need to save Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can restore his self-image!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll extract the image\Nof him stored in their
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fluctlights and connect\Nit to the damaged regions!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should repair his subjective\Nself. Hot down. This is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no what am i saying this won't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The equipment i need to run everything\Nis in the main freaking control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't beat yourself up,\NHiga. We have a better
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shot at restoring Kirito\Nnow and that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now we wait once\Nour guests leave and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ocean turtles ours\Nagain we'll get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Asahi sends commandos to board us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they end up fighting the\Nhijackers in the main shaft,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it could knock out the power in Subcon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:12:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito's STL would shut down and\Nhe'd be logged out of the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that state, we'd never get him to pass\Nthe initialization stage, and he'll never
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be able to connect to the STL again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, right now, while
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he and those girls are\Nstill in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our only shot at saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it, Keeks. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, here's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a cable duct running down\Nthe stern side of the main shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It connects STL-2,\NKirito's room, to main con.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to climb down the duct until\NI get to the maintenance connector.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll patch into it, and I should be\Nable to control Kirito's STL from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that connector is on the same\Nside of the bulkhead as the hijackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they find out you're in the duct,\Nthey'll breach it and attack you from below.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, so I'll need a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you do. But who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not who.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want anyone here\Nto risk their life too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll unlock the bulkhead door,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then send some thing that can't get\Nkilled on a walk downstairs to Minigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it. Ichiemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all it can do is walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't fight or run or anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they see him coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're just gonna blow it to\Npieces and that's the end of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sucks for Ichiemon, but\Nhe's the best decoy we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, with how he looks, they might\Nthink he'll explode if they shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he'll definitely get their\Nattention, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they might think we sent\Nhim down there because
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're planning something\Neven more ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the point of sending him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, while the hijackers\Nare dealing with Ichiemon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll climb into the\Nlower part of the duct,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,patch into that connector, and\Noperate Kirito's STL from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have two robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.22,0:13:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should send the aim on. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I told Asuna before this\Nnightmare started, he's not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs a Fluctlight to\Npilot and keep him in balance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or he'll just roll down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, I'm not so sure about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the decoy works,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you're in that duct you're vulnerable,\Nand if they find you in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take an agent to\Nkeep an eye out while you work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The JSDF agents have to stay\Nhere to keep all of you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, the duct is way too\Nnarrow for most folks to fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not for a skinny little nerd like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be down and back before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hirito risked everything for this project.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for him, Alice's Fluctlight\Nwouldn't have developed into what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he's in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why, if there's a chance to\Nsave him, I have to take it. Doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter if I'm risking my life it's\Nthe only way I can make it up to him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,um if you don't mind I'd like to go
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with you and be your bodyguard I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty skinny myself but there's enough\Nmeat on my bones to stop a bullet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it comes to that, I'm also the\None in charge of cable maintenance here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, to be honest, I'm not 100 %\Nsure how far down that connector is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're okay with it,\NI could use the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soul is too thick\Nand heavy, too simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sticks to my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you can think about is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still got some life in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirty seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:17:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,579, 580, 581, 582.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what could you possibly be up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss, dammit. Forgive\Nme, little Asuna... Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I thought I told you to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time you\Ndisobeyed me, stubborn old dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Shagami, thanks for giving me\None more chance, I won't waste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the time-splitting\Nsword, I can cut two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future and the past, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was captured by Emperor Vecta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, kiddo. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all gotta go sometime, and\Nthis was just mine, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:20:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to handle things on\Nyour own now, but she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my apprentice after\Nall, and my precious daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, at least we\Nwent out in style, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many people will mourn your passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lady, fancy seeing your ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'm not a ghost, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just the me that\Nexists in your memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the memory you had of Administrator\NOne, which you held dear in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you say so, my lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how it is, then it's\Ngood to know that you—I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.58,0:20:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember I never could smile like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find it odd you don't despise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I was the one who\Nforced immortality on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I kept robbing you of your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll admit, after the first\Nhundred years it got old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, my life\Nwas pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Fanatio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like we won't be\Nseeing each other for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:22:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to give our baby\Na happy life. You hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, my commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I will raise our child well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.32,0:22:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will be strong and brave\Nand proud like their father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.32,0:22:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look who's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you got your ass\Nkicked in there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the latest?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did everything like you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sent in 50,000 players from the U\N.S., and they're tearing it up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and that jackass\NVassago got killed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he got excited about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had me convert his Gamer\Naccount and dove back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Critter, convert that\Naccount to the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still need to take care of some things.
